ations, row-level security, storage, and an Edge Function, while Expo powers the responsive web, iOS, and Android experience.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Rift Scout","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/17dd03d42df20f6e143de122eea6149f/d2194/rift-scout.png","srcSet":"/static/17dd03d42df20f6e143de122eea6149f/cebcc/rift-scout.png 175w,\n/static/17dd03d42df20f6e143de122eea6149f/272cf/rift-scout.png 350w,\n/static/17dd03d42df20f6e143de122eea6149f/d2194/rift-scout.png 700w,\n/static/17dd03d42df20f6e143de122eea6149f/b50c4/rift-scout.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/17dd03d42df20f6e143de122eea6149f/9aa63/rift-scout.avif 175w,\n/static/17dd03d42df20f6e143de122eea6149f/e6db6/rift-scout.avif 350w,\n/static/17dd03d42df20f6e143de122eea6149f/f47db/rift-scout.avif 700w,\n/static/17dd03d42df20f6e143de122eea6149f/8fee6/rift-scout.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/17dd03d42df20f6e143de122eea6149f/240e7/rift-scout.webp 175w,\n/static/17dd03d42df20f6e143de122eea6149f/faefe/rift-scout.webp 350w,\n/static/17dd03d42df20f6e143de122eea6149f/d5dc4/rift-scout.webp 700w,\n/static/17dd03d42df20f6e143de122eea6149f/e2f1a/rift-scout.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":438}}},"tech":["React","TypeScript","Riot Games API","REST API"],"github":null,"external":"https://rift-scout-jabinx92.jabinx92.chatgpt.site/"},"html":"<p>Rift Scout turns a League of Legends Riot ID into an easy-to-read snapshot of a player's ranked journey. Search by player and region to explore rank, wins and losses, recent form, and champion performance—all in one focused dashboard.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Multi Mini Projects","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"